  "summary": "Malicious code in nebulaai-sdk (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (preinstall.js) embeds a large base64-encoded gzip blob, decompresses it, and writes the resulting binary to %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Microsoft\\Conhost\\conhost.exe — a hidden directory that mimics a Windows system path. It then executes that dropped binary detached and hidden (stdio ignored, windowsHide set). The package's main module (nebula.js) is a decoy AI SDK client that is not the real purpose of the package. Installing this package drops and runs an unknown binary on the host.",
